<title>POLAND: POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 24.</title>
<headline>POLISH BOURSE KERB BOND DEALS - JANUARY 24.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kerb trade through the Warsaw Stock Exchange on Friday saw 112,406 variable-interest three-year bonds maturing on November 9, 1997 trading at 103.1 zlotys, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Turnover was 12.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
